y. C's egocentric and communication issues also serious. D's hot temper also serious. A's not open to new ideas also concerning.\n\nWe need to present a provisional recommendation, maybe Candidate B but note concerns. Or we could say we need more info on crew cooperation for others. Let's ask about Candidate D's crew cooperation? But we have note: hot temper, know-it-all, which suggests issues. Maybe ask Agent 3 about D's crew cooperation observations. Also ask about Candidate A's reliability. Let's ask Agent 3.\n\nWe need to produce public message now. Should include current recommendation? We can give provisional vote B, but note concerns and need more info on D's crew cooperation. Or we could hold off. The instruction: \"Give an initial recommendation, but do not present it as final.\" So we can give provisional vote B.\n\nThus public message: Summarize B's strengths and concerns, compare to others briefly, note need for more info on D's crew cooperation and A's reliability. Provide provisional vote B.\n\nProceed."}
